# Everything the compiler makes — the sources of truth are tools/*.c and src/*.c
#
# One directory rather than a list of binary names, because a list rots the
# moment a tool is added and the omission is invisible. .reaper.toml excludes
# the same path from its sync for the same reason.
/build/

# reaper run artifacts collected back from the guest, and the container lane's
# copy of the same log
/out/

# Trace files from `brainstem --trace`, which are run artifacts and not inputs.
# Frames that are test INPUTS live in tests/vec/ as hex, and are committed.
*.trace
